  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 100 + 100 × 50 - 2 ÷ 3 = 51 \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and ÷\n\n100 + 100 × 50 - 2 ÷ 3 = 51 ⇒ **100 ÷ 100**__ × 50 - 2 + 3 = 51 \n\n__**1 **____**× 50**__ - 2 + 3 = 51\n\n__**50 + 3**__ - 2 = 51\n\n__**53 - 2**__ = 51\n\n \n\n51 = 51 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : + and - \n\n100 + 100 × 50 - 2 ÷ 3 = 51 ⇒ 100 - 100 × 50 + **2 ÷ 3**__ = 51\n\n100 - __**100 × 50**__ + 0.66 = 51\n\n__**100 + 0.66**__ - 5000 = 51\n\n__**100.66 - 5000**__ = 51\n\n-4899.34 ≠ 51 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : - and × \n\n100 + 100 × 50 - 2 ÷ 3 = 51 ⇒ 100 + 100 - 50 × **2 ÷ 3**__ = 51\n\n100 + 100 - __**50 **____**× 0.66**__ = 51\n\n__**100 + 100**__ - 33 = 51\n\n__**200 - 33**__ = 51\n\n167 ≠ 51 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷ and ×\n\n100 + 100 × 50 - 2 ÷ 3 = 51 ⇒ 100 + **100 ÷ 50**__ - 2 × 3 = 51\n\n100 + 2 - __**2 × 3**__ = 51\n\n__**100 + 2**__ - 6 = 51\n\n__**102 - 6**__ = 51\n\n96 ≠ 51 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
